title: The Warrant
subtitle: The State Court issues a warrant for the party's leader.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: year = 1923 and month >= 11 and kpd_banned = 1 and e23_ban_done = 1 and e23_flight_done = 0 and crisis = 0 and congress = 0
max-visits: 1
priority: 3
on-arrival: {!
Q.e23_flight_done = 1;
var lead = {unionist: ['brandler', 'thalheimer'], offensive: ['fischer', 'maslow', 'thalmann'],
    luxemburgist: ['luxemburg', 'levi', 'meyer', 'pieck', 'zetkin'], ultraleft: ['ruhle', 'schroder']}[Q.leading_faction] || [];
lead = lead.concat(['brandler', 'fischer', 'meyer', 'pieck']);
var id = lead.filter(function (c) { return RG.isFree(c); })[0] || 0;
Q.e23_fl_id = id;
Q.e23_fl_name = id ? RG.comradeName(id) : 0;
Q.e23_fl_has = id ? 1 : 0;
Q.e23_fl_ok = 0;
!}

= The Warrant

[? if e23_fl_has = 1 : The State Court in Leipzig has issued a warrant for **[+ e23_fl_name +]**, for high treason: preparing an armed rising against the constitution of the Reich. The charge sheet runs to forty pages. Somebody has given the prosecutor the minutes of meetings that only a dozen people attended. ?][? if e23_fl_has = 0 : The State Court in Leipzig has issued warrants for the whole of the Zentrale. There is nobody left at liberty to arrest who matters, and the police arrest the district secretaries instead. ?]

[? if e23_fl_has = 1 : The police have the flat in Neukölln under watch, and the safe flat in Steglitz. A comrade on the railways says there is a goods train to Bodenbach on Thursday night, and a guard who owes the party a favour. ?]

- @abroad: Get [+ e23_fl_name +] across the border to Czechoslovakia.
- @hide: Hide [+ e23_fl_name +] in Berlin, and keep working.
- @dock: Let [+ e23_fl_name +] stand trial, and speak from the dock.
- @nobody: Close the offices and wait for the storm to pass.

@abroad
subtitle: Safe, and far away. The party at home must manage without its leader.
view-if: e23_fl_has = 1
on-arrival: {!
RG.exile(Q.e23_fl_id, {news: Q.e23_fl_name + ' escapes to Czechoslovakia'});
Q.unity -= 2;
Q.independence -= 3;
RG.ledger(Q.e23_fl_name + ' fled abroad after the ban.', 'e23_flight');
!}

On Thursday night [+ e23_fl_name +] climbs into an empty coal wagon at the Dresden goods yard. By Friday morning the train is in Bodenbach, and the Czech comrades are waiting with a car. The next letter from the Zentrale to the districts is posted in Prague.

@hide
subtitle: A gamble. If it works, the party keeps its leader at home. If not, the police have a trophy.
view-if: e23_fl_has = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.e23_fl_ok = Math.random() < 0.55 ? 1 : 0;
if (Q.e23_fl_ok) {
    Q.unity += 3;
    Q.red_guards_loyalty += 3;
    RG.setRole(Q.e23_fl_id, 'Leads the party in hiding');
} else {
    RG.arrest(Q.e23_fl_id, 12, {news: Q.e23_fl_name + ' arrested in Berlin'});
    Q.unity -= 4;
    RG.ledger(Q.e23_fl_name + ' was arrested in hiding in Berlin.', 'e23_flight');
}
!}

[? if e23_fl_ok = 1 : [+ e23_fl_name +] moves every second night: an allotment hut in Treptow, a dentist's flat in Charlottenburg, a room above a bakery in Wedding. The police search everywhere twice. The party's circulars keep coming, signed with a name everyone knows. ?][? if e23_fl_ok = 0 : The police come to the room above the bakery at four in the morning. They know exactly which stair creaks. ?]

@dock
subtitle: Prison, and a speech the whole country will read. Worker support rises.
view-if: e23_fl_has = 1
on-arrival: {!
RG.arrest(Q.e23_fl_id, 12, {news: Q.e23_fl_name + ' surrenders to the State Court'});
Q.worker_support += 4;
Q.militancy += 3;
Q.unity += 2;
RG.ledger(Q.e23_fl_name + ' stood trial before the State Court rather than flee.', 'e23_flight');
!}

[+ e23_fl_name +] walks into the police headquarters on the Alexanderplatz with a lawyer and a prepared statement. The trial will take months. The speech from the dock will be printed in every language of the International.

@nobody
subtitle: Nothing is risked, and nothing is done.
view-if: e23_fl_has = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.unity -= 2;
!}

The district secretaries go to prison, and their deputies take their places, and the deputies of the deputies prepare to.
